            "notes": "# Round 2\n\nBoth starts should take the [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0)+[Tourniquet](item_f457a404-70c1-4f1b-b6da-8fa2e90aad54) combo, it's the best base build for staying alive in the air regardless of playstyle/damage type.\n\n*However...*\n## AP Start\nI have gotten away with buying just [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4) and [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295). Fast ults. Use with care.",
